			"notes": "Added canonicalized `FriendRelationship` UUID pairs to represent symmetric friendships, `TeamRole`, immutable `Team` snapshots with exactly one owner and a nonblank trimmed name, and `TeamDirectory` validation that each player belongs to at most one team. Added focused JUnit tests for symmetry, owner invariants, invalid names, and cross-team membership."
