			"notes": "The user launched the previous button-based prototype with SocialCore-GT installed on both server and client, verified that its entry points opened the placeholder and returned with Back, and reported two identical buttons; that layout was unintended and has now been replaced in source with per-player row actions. The current row-action build still needs client runtime verification. An attempted Loom `runServer` launch in this environment could not resolve Minecraft native libraries because connections to `libraries.minecraft.net` were reset by both Gradle and `curl`. Verify the latest build on a dedicated server and client; verify an unmodded client can connect (the fallback GUI itself is implemented in Phase 6). Do not treat compilation or task discovery as runtime verification."
		},
