			"notes": "**Completed — Logging and defaults:** Added SLF4J logging for common initialization and server readiness, plus a built-in JSON config at `config/socialcore-gt/config.json`. The config defaults `clientScreenIntegrationEnabled` to `true`, allows clients to hide the Social Interactions screen entry point, and reports read/write/parse failures while falling back to defaults. No additional dependency was added."
