			"notes": "**Implemented — Common/server and client initialization:** Added a common initializer with server-start logging and a client initializer that hooks into the existing `SocialInteractionsScreen` after initialization. This reuses Minecraft's configurable P-key entry point without registering a competing binding. The client entry button opens an initial placeholder screen with back navigation. Loom compiles client classes into the separate client source set; common/server initialization does not reference client classes. `.\\gradlew.bat clean build` succeeds with JDK 25."
